============================================================================
UBUNTU BASE CONTAINER PACKAGES
============================================================================
The components listed below are installed from the Ubuntu 24.04 APT
repository into the VIOS release container image, on top of the NVIDIA CUDA
base container. They are redistributed unmodified, in binary form, under the
licenses stated. Each entry reproduces the verbatim copyright and license text
as shipped in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright inside the container image.

